name horizon
describe Prompt 007 goal 343. Looks at the far edge of the 4 km region from a hilltop. Goal 330's honest negative lives here: at clear-air visibility the region boundary IS visible, and this is the scenario that will show it stop being visible when a far silhouette tier exists.
backend both

option --no-taa
option --no-auto-exposure
option --noclip
# The authored visibility, not a fog density (goal 327). 20 km is the "clear" band.
option --visibility 20000

pose 0,90,0 90 -3
wait 3

capture end horizon no-golden

assert frames > 0
